_event_description:
Trashy Girls Collective, Pompano Beach 2-Tank SCUBA diving cleanup this Saturday, March 16th - boat leaves the dock at 8:30am, we'll be back at dock at 12:30pm. Two reef dives, max depths between 45'-60' - Must be Open Water SCUBA certified, and have been diving in the last 8 months. Must bring your own gloves and cleanup items, we love wearing our <a href="https://trshbg.com/">TRSHBG</a> on every dive!

Boat ticket is $96, any rental gear/tanks are additional. Shoot us an email to trashygirlscollective@gmail.com for more info and to reserve your spot, limited space available!

&nbsp;
